{
  "id": "1CO.16",
  "number": "16",
  "bookId": "1CO",
  "reference": "1 Corinthians 16",
  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now concerning the collection for the saints, as I gave order to the churches of Galatia, so also do ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Upon the first day of the week let each one of you lay by him in store, as he may prosper, that no collections be made when I come. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when I arrive, whomsoever ye shall approve, them will I send with letters to carry your bounty unto Jerusalem: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and if it be meet for me to go also, they shall go with me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I will come unto you, when I shall have passed through Macedonia; for I pass through Macedonia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but with you it may be that I shall abide, or even winter, that ye may set me forward on my journey whithersoever I go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I do not wish to see you now by the way; for I hope to tarry a while with you, if the Lord permit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I will tarry at Ephesus until Pentecost; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for a great door and effectual is opened unto me, and there are many adversaries.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now if Timothy come, see that he be with you without fear; for he worketh the work of the Lord, as I also do: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "let no man therefore despise him. But set him forward on his journey in peace, that he may come unto me: for I expect him with the brethren. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But as touching Apollos the brother, I besought him much to come unto you with the brethren: and it was not at all ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will to come now; but he will come when he shall have opportunity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watch ye, stand fast in the faith, quit you like men, be strong. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let all that ye do be done in love.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now I beseech you, brethren (ye know the house of Stephanas, that it is the firstfruits of Achaia, and that they have set themselves to minister unto the saints), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that ye also be in subjection unto such, and to every one that helpeth in the work and laboreth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I rejoice at the coming of Stephanas and Fortunatus and Achaicus: for that which was lacking on your part they supplied. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they refreshed my spirit and yours: acknowledge ye therefore them that are such.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The churches of Asia salute you. Aquila and Prisca salute you much in the Lord, with the church that is in their house. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the brethren salute you. Salute one another with a holy kiss.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The salutation of me Paul with mine own hand. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If any man loveth not the Lord, let him be anathema. Maranatha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The grace of the Lord Jesus Christ be with you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My love be with you all in Christ Jesus. Amen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
